<Base title="AI & automation in Arizona | HourlyTechs" description="Get practical assistance choosing tools, learning how to use them and building workflows that solve a specific problem."><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Arizona / AI & automation</p><h1>Make AI useful in your everyday work.</h1><p class="lead">Get practical assistance choosing tools, learning how to use them and building workflows that solve a specific problem.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/booking/">How to get help</a><a class="plain" href="/#pricing">Compare rates</a></div><p class="note">Service launch in development.</p></div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1753613648137-602c669cbe07?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1100&amp;q=82" alt="Person working with software on a laptop" width="1100" height="760" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="hero-photo-rate">$96/hr scheduled · $144/hr on demand<small>Planned launch rates · billed by the minute</small></div></div></div></section><section class="block"><div class="wrap"><h2>What we can help with</h2><div class="service-grid"><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/sparkles.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>AI tool setup</h3><p>Compare tools for your use case and configure accounts, settings and everyday workflows.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/graduation-cap.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>Hands-on training</h3><p>Learn to give clear instructions, refine outputs and verify AI-generated information.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/files.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>Document workflows</h3><p>Explore ways to summarize, classify and extract information from suitable documents.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/workflow.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>Workflow automation</h3><p>Connect compatible applications to reduce repetitive copying, notifications and manual handoffs.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/bot.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>Business assistants</h3><p>Design reusable instructions and templates for recurring administrative or research tasks.</p></article><article class="service"><span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/list-checks.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"/></span><h3>Evaluation & safeguards</h3><p>Test outputs against examples, identify failure modes and define where human review remains necessary.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="block pricing"><div class="wrap"><h2>How remote help works</h2><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Describe the issue</h3><p>Tell us what you are trying to accomplish, what device or software you use and what has gone wrong.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Agree on a plan</h3><p>Confirm the appropriate specialty, rate and scope before starting a session.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Work with a technician</h3><p>Follow guided steps or approve remote access when appropriate, and review the outcome together.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="block"><div class="wrap"><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="service-grid"><article class="service"><h3>Can you automate everything?</h3><p>Not every process is suitable. We start with a defined task and assess feasibility, permissions and reliability.</p></article><article class="service"><h3>How does project billing work?</h3><p>Training and implementation use agreed deliverables and billing terms rather than the repair guarantee.</p></article><article class="service"><h3>Can I upload confidential information to AI tools?</h3><p>Check your organization's rules and the tool's data handling terms before sharing sensitive information.</p></article></div><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/booking/">Explore booking</a><a class="plain" href="/#services">Other services</a></div></div></section></Base>